OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers. Showers will be occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy. Feeling rather cool in the
OL,9,Ffresh occasionally strong west or
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will see further
OL,13,Fshowers. Then becoming drier overnight
OL,14,Fwith clear periods but a few showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing across the north. Fresh
OL,16,Fnorthwesterly winds easing down.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FA few showers at first
OL,19,Facross northern Aberdeenshire
OL,20,Fotherwise dry with bright spells.
OL,21,FLighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
